        "text": "tailDebt d = ∫ v in (0:ℝ)..3, exp (primitive (tailRate d) v) * (tailShapeDeriv d v / tailShape d v), with tailRate d = 1 + tailLogSlope d and primitive f v = ∫ 0..v f"
